    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 643,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "1. Beta status"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b0c780be837e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.023",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 706,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA is currently in private beta. Features, data structures, interfaces and support scope",
        "may change. Some capabilities may be unstable or temporarily unavailable."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9a7b6c32d7a6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 788,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "2. User data"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-399642a4862f",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 851,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Users retain the relevant rights in content they enter, edit and import. PAIA aims to make this",
        "material viewable, manageable and exportable, rather than create barriers by locking in user",
        "data."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5a24d5d2a62b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "3. Backups"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-bf7e6f2499f5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1023,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "During beta, do not use PAIA as the only copy of important data. Keep independent backups",
        "of material that needs long-term preservation."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ccb4d57744aa",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1105,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "4. Acceptable use"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d702c60fe4d5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.029",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 29,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1168,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Do not use PAIA for unlawful activity, unauthorized data collection, violations of others’",
        "privacy or intellectual property, or circumvention of third-party access and usage",
        "restrictions."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5341165bab3d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.030",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 30,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1277,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "5. Third-party services"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d59bf2c0ed94",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.031",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 31,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA may work with browsers, AI services and other third-party platforms. PAIA does not",
        "control their availability, terms or technical changes, which may require changes to related",
        "features."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2b56bd0fc1a4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.032",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 32,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1449,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "6. Availability and limitations"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-633a817979a0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.033",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 33,
      "x": 504,
      "y": 1512,
      "width": 702,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "The beta is provided in its current state, without a promise of continuous, error-free or",
        "permanent availability. The product seeks to reduce data risks, but users should keep",
        "independent backups of important material."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-98fbd7865446",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-en-1440.034",
      "kind": "text",
